    "plain_text": "Jacques Bruynooghe is a Belgian industrialist who built his fortune in clothing manufacture. He established a textile group in Tunisia in the mid-1970s, centred on Ksar Hellal near Monastir. Known as JBG, the business grew to encompass five local subsidiaries, making him a prominent figure in the city’s garment industry.",
